# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Oversized source archive — intentionally NOT committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paperlords_All_IGCSE_Archive_4EC1_4BS1_4EB1.zip is 112,136,376 bytes
# (~106.9 MiB), which exceeds GitHub's hard per-file limit of 100 MiB.
#
# This file is fully reconstructible, so nothing is lost:
#   sha256 : dd7019de06bc4f9b81a3641062bd93d2d10b27edb32ac4070c838c33fa3cea6b
#   source : bundle_part_aa + bundle_part_ab (tracked in this repo)
#   unpack : `cat bundle_part_aa bundle_part_ab > master.zip && unzip master.zip`
#
# All 220 archive entries (217 PDFs + manifest.csv, recovery_notes.csv,
# README.txt) are extracted into Paperlords_Archive/IGCSE/ and
# Paperlords_Archive/RECOVERED_ALTERNATIVES/ and ARE tracked normally.
#
# The bundle was ALSO committed a second time as seven 20 MiB parts named
# bundle_part_aa.txt ... bundle_part_ag.txt - the same payload chunked
# differently. That was verified on 14 Oct 2026, not assumed:
#
#   cat bundle_part_aa.txt bundle_part_ab.txt bundle_part_ac.txt \
#       bundle_part_ad.txt bundle_part_ae.txt bundle_part_af.txt \
#       bundle_part_ag.txt | sha256sum
#   -> a66d301fe9d525a3197c7d8ca7606f7936ea01c116ff8c6dbdff9056f577d44b
#
# which is the same hash, and the same 132,690,284 bytes, that the two binary
# parts produce. Nothing in this repo referenced the .txt parts, and two
# byte-identical copies of a 126.5 MiB deliverable are not redundancy worth
# carrying, so they were deleted (reclaiming 126.5 MiB of the repo). They are
# still in the history if ever needed:
#
#   git show 304db7a:bundle_part_aa.txt | head -c 32
#
# Because the .txt set was produced by the same split as the delivered bundle,
# its parts are NOT separately reconstructible - deleting any of them would have
# destroyed the copy. That is precisely why the duplicate was removed whole
# rather than partially.
Paperlords_Archive/Paperlords_All_IGCSE_Archive_4EC1_4BS1_4EB1.zip

# Intermediate extraction scratch
/tmp/
.scratch/
.venv/
*.part

