# Rendered examiner-report scans — regenerable, and 177 MB if kept
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every PNG under audits/corpus/scripts_png/ is produced from the stored PDFs by
#   python3 audits/extract_scripts.py --all
# which rebuilds the whole set (457 images, ~1 minute) and rewrites
